  - m_Id: 6028775593598983
    m_Localized: Forgotten Sands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593598984
    m_Localized: Waterfalls of Hope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593598985
    m_Localized: Crystal Dungeons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593598988
    m_Localized: Something from the Deep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593598991
    m_Localized: You stared into the darkness... until the darkness stared back.
      It was a huge crystal monster being.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593599004
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll try to slip past... slowly. Never breaking eye contact."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593599005
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll offer it some crystal shards."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593599006
    m_Localized: I will offer him a crystal heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593599007
    m_Localized: That thing snagged your pack. Treasures fell to the ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593599008
    m_Localized: You inserted pure crystal shards into its gap. The creature shivered...
      then retreated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593599009
    m_Localized: You placed the heart into the gap. The monster stillened. You can
      pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593599010
    m_Localized: Upgrade <style="currency">{0}</style>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6028775593599011
    m_Localized: Sell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6475610980343808
    m_Localized: '{0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6475610934206464
    m_Localized: Exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6475610980343809
    m_Localized: '{0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439139909632
    m_Localized: Pirate Spider
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046976
    m_Localized: Crying Ghost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046977
    m_Localized: Yarrr! Ye've stumbled right into the Pirate Spider's lair! Tonight,
      ye be its dinner!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046978
    m_Localized: "Suddenly, before you stands the ghost of a little girl. She\u2019s...
      crying?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046979
    m_Localized: I'll poke out its beady eyes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046980
    m_Localized: I'll lob some scrap iron at it - send it flyin' off the cliff!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046981
    m_Localized: Might be I can buy me way past with some shiny doublons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046982
    m_Localized: Ye took a swing at the beast but missed yer mark! Treasure spilled
      from yer sack right into its web.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046983
    m_Localized: The mangy spider weren't in no fightin' mood. It turned tail and
      skittered down the rocks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046984
    m_Localized: Ye tossed the hairy brute a handful o' pirate coin. Aye, seems ye're
      free to pass... fer now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046985
    m_Localized: '"Aa-agh! THERE''S NO WAY... Ghost aren''t real!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046986
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll throw a seashell at her - maybe it\u2019ll scare her
      off."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046987
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll tell her a fairytale... about a ghost girl."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046988
    m_Localized: You flinched so hard that treasure spilled from your pack. She drifted
      away...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046989
    m_Localized: The seashell passed right through her. Her sobs grew louder, and
      she vanished. Well done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6506439186046990
    m_Localized: The story seemed to soothe her. Her tears faded... a moment later
      she was gone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6549068556787712
    m_Localized: Press to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6591409277648896
    m_Localized: "Thanks for Playing!\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
